# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DATUM portal — environment template.
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. NEVER commit real values (see /.gitignore).
# In production these are set in the Vercel + Supabase secret stores.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Supabase (auth + Postgres w/ RLS) ---
# Public, safe to expose to the browser:
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL="https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co"
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY="your-anon-key"

# SERVICE-ROLE KEY BYPASSES RLS. Server-only. Do NOT expose to the browser and
# do NOT use it for client-facing reads. Reserved for trusted server jobs only.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY="your-service-role-key"

# --- Stripe (read-only in this app) ---
# Secret key is server-only. The app reads payment state; it never handles cards.
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY="sk_test_..."
# Optional, for later steps (webhooks):
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET="whsec_..."

# --- Test-only: direct Postgres connection for the hermetic RLS isolation test ---
# Used by `npm test` (tests/isolation.test.ts) and CI against a throwaway Postgres.
# Leave empty locally to skip the DB-backed isolation test.
TEST_DATABASE_URL=""
